{"slug":"gpu-expo-poster","name":"GPU Expo Poster","zh":"显卡科技展览海报","tag":"近黑底 + 橙色 RGB 光效的三风扇显卡主视觉，宽体巨型标题，适合电竞 / PC 硬件 / 科技展会。","type":"poster","size":{"label":"Instagram portrait 4:5","w":1080,"h":1350},"styles":["futuristic","dark","bold"],"ind":["gaming","tech","events"],"colors":{"primary":"#FF6A00","secondary":"#1A1D22","text":"#F4F4F2","accent":"#FFB070","surface":"#0B0D10","border":"#2A2E35"},"fonts":{"head":"Unbounded","body":"Jost"},"html":"<style>\n.g-gx{position:relative;width:1080px;height:1350px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--c-surface);color:var(--c-text);font-family:var(--f-body);box-sizing:border-box}\n.g-gx *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}\n.g-gx .bg{position:absolute;inset:0;background:radial-gradient(820px 560px at 50% 27%,rgba(255,106,0,.26),transparent 70%),linear-gradient(180deg,#14171c 0%,var(--c-surface) 58%,#07080a 100%)}\n.g-gx .grid{position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:linear-gradient(var(--c-border) 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(90deg,var(--c-border) 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:72px 72px;opacity:.26;-webkit-mask-image:radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 30%,#000 15%,transparent 72%);mask-image:radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 30%,#000 15%,transparent 72%)}\n.g-gx .band{position:absolute;right:-110px;top:-50px;width:560px;height:250px;background:linear-gradient(100deg,rgba(255,255,255,.10),rgba(255,255,255,0));transform:skewX(-32deg)}\n.g-gx .dots{position:absolute;right:0;top:0;width:380px;height:220px;background-image:radial-gradient(var(--c-primary) 2.8px,transparent 3.4px);background-size:16px 16px;-webkit-mask-image:linear-gradient(225deg,#000,transparent 70%);mask-image:linear-gradient(225deg,#000,transparent 70%);opacity:.8}\n/* header: organizer logo slot (replace with the real logo PNG) */\n.g-gx .org{position:absolute;left:56px;top:46px;height:64px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px}\n.g-gx .org svg{width:58px;height:58px}\n.g-gx .org b{font:500 30px/1 var(--f-body);letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase}\n.g-gx .org b i{font-style:normal;color:var(--c-primary)}\n.g-gx .ed{position:absolute;right:56px;top:72px;font:600 17px/1 var(--f-body);letter-spacing:.4em;text-transform:uppercase}\n.g-gx .presents{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;top:158px;text-align:center;font:500 18px/1 var(--f-body);letter-spacing:.7em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--c-mute,#9AA0AA)}\n/* the graphics card */\n.g-gx .gpu{position:absolute;left:60px;top:226px;width:960px;height:410px}\n.g-gx .glow{position:absolute;left:5%;right:5%;bottom:-70px;height:120px;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(ellipse,rgba(255,106,0,.55),transparent 70%)}\n.g-gx .bracket{position:absolute;left:-26px;top:28px;width:34px;height:336px;border-radius:6px 0 0 6px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#8d939c,#d9dde3 55%,#9aa0a9)}\n.g-gx .bracket i{position:absolute;left:8px;width:18px;height:34px;border-radius:3px;background:#101215}\n.g-gx .bracket i:nth-child(1){top:46px}.g-gx .bracket i:nth-child(2){top:98px}.g-gx .bracket i:nth-child(3){top:150px}.g-gx .bracket i:nth-child(4){top:202px;height:66px}\n.g-gx .power{position:absolute;right:70px;top:-16px;width:130px;height:30px;border-radius:5px 5px 0 0;background:#0b0c0e;border:2px solid #2a2e35;border-bottom:0}\n.g-gx .power::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:7px 10px 0;background:repeating-linear-gradient(90deg,#3a3f48 0 10px,transparent 10px 16px)}\n.g-gx .body{position:absolute;left:0;top:0;width:960px;height:364px;clip-path:polygon(0 9%,4.5% 0,95.5% 0,100% 10%,100% 91%,95.5% 100%,4.5% 100%,0 90%);background:linear-gradient(160deg,#323843 0%,#1a1d23 45%,#0e1013 100%)}\n.g-gx .body::before{content:\"\";position:absolute;left:0;right:0;top:0;height:26px;background:repeating-linear-gradient(90deg,#0b0c0e 0 3px,#2c3139 3px 8px);opacity:.9}\n.g-gx .strip{position:absolute;left:5%;right:5%;top:30px;height:5px;border-radius:3px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,var(--c-primary) 18%,#ffd2a8 50%,var(--c-primary) 82%,transparent);box-shadow:0 0 18px var(--c-primary)}\n.g-gx .slash{position:absolute;left:0;bottom:0;width:300px;height:12px;background:var(--c-primary);transform-origin:left bottom}\n.g-gx .model{position:absolute;right:48px;bottom:20px;font:600 15px/1 var(--f-head);letter-spacing:.34em;color:#8b919b;text-transform:uppercase}\n.g-gx .fan{position:absolute;top:62px;width:272px;height:272px;border-radius:50%;background:#0a0b0d;border:10px solid #21252c;box-shadow:0 0 0 2px #3a404a,0 0 34px rgba(255,106,0,.35),inset 0 0 30px #000}\n.g-gx .fan.a{left:48px}.g-gx .fan.b{left:344px}.g-gx .fan.c{left:640px}\n.g-gx .fan::before{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:12px;border-radius:50%;background:repeating-conic-gradient(from 12deg,#4a505b 0 17deg,#171a1f 17deg 51.43deg);-webkit-mask-image:radial-gradient(circle,transparent 0 22%,#000 23%);mask-image:radial-gradient(circle,transparent 0 22%,#000 23%)}\n.g-gx .fan::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:4px;border-radius:50%;border:5px solid var(--c-primary);box-shadow:0 0 16px var(--c-primary),inset 0 0 16px rgba(255,106,0,.55)}\n.g-gx .fan s{position:absolute;inset:12px;border-radius:50%;background:conic-gradient(from 0deg,rgba(0,0,0,0),rgba(0,0,0,.6) 14%,rgba(0,0,0,0) 28%,rgba(0,0,0,.6) 42%,rgba(0,0,0,0) 56%,rgba(0,0,0,.6) 70%,rgba(0,0,0,0) 84%)}\n.g-gx .fan i{position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;width:84px;height:84px;margin:-42px 0 0 -42px;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle at 35% 30%,#3a3f49,#0d0f12);border:4px solid #3a404a}\n.g-gx .fan i::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:26px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--c-primary);box-shadow:0 0 14px var(--c-primary)}\n.g-gx .fingers{position:absolute;left:150px;top:364px;width:520px;height:30px;border-radius:0 0 4px 4px;background:repeating-linear-gradient(90deg,#d9a441 0 6px,#6f5320 6px 8px)}\n.g-gx .ph{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;top:404px;text-align:center;font-size:14px;letter-spacing:.16em;color:#6c727c}\n/* stats */\n.g-gx .rib{position:absolute;top:676px;height:58px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:0 24px;background:rgba(255,106,0,.16);border-top:2px solid var(--c-primary);border-bottom:2px solid var(--c-primary);font:800 26px/1 var(--f-head)}\n.g-gx .rib small{font:500 14px/1.2 var(--f-body);letter-spacing:.26em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--c-accent)}\n.g-gx .rib.l{left:0;width:300px;padding-left:56px}\n.g-gx .rib.r{right:0;width:300px;justify-content:flex-end;padding-right:56px}\n/* title + info */\n.g-gx .t1{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;top:770px;text-align:center;font:800 78px/1 var(--f-head);text-transform:uppercase}\n.g-gx .t2{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;top:858px;text-align:center;font:800 236px/1 var(--f-head);text-transform:uppercase}\n.g-gx .t2 i{font-style:normal;color:var(--c-primary)}\n.g-gx .info{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;top:1124px;text-align:center}\n.g-gx .when{font:500 25px/1.2 var(--f-body);letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase}\n.g-gx .when b{display:inline-block;width:2px;height:24px;background:var(--c-primary);margin:0 18px;vertical-align:-4px}\n.g-gx .venue{margin-top:12px;font:700 27px/1.2 var(--f-body);letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase}\n.g-gx .addr{margin-top:5px;font:400 21px/1.3 var(--f-body);color:#9AA0AA}\n.g-gx .url{position:absolute;left:50%;bottom:38px;transform:translateX(-50%);display:flex;align-items:center}\n.g-gx .url span{display:block;padding:13px 38px;background:var(--c-primary);color:var(--on-primary);font:700 22px/1 var(--f-body);letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:lowercase}\n.g-gx .url::before,.g-gx .url::after{content:\"\";width:110px;height:46px;background-image:radial-gradient(var(--c-primary) 2.2px,transparent 2.8px);background-size:10px 10px}\n.g-gx .url::before{-webkit-mask-image:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,#000);mask-image:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,#000)}\n.g-gx .url::after{-webkit-mask-image:linear-gradient(270deg,transparent,#000);mask-image:linear-gradient(270deg,transparent,#000)}\n</style>\n<div class=\"g-gx\">\n  <div class=\"bg\"></div><div class=\"grid\"></div><div class=\"band\"></div><div class=\"dots\"></div>\n  <div class=\"org\" data-slot=\"logo\">\n    <svg viewBox=\"0 0 64 64\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M52 18A26 26 0 1 0 56 36\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ececec\" stroke-width=\"7\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M24 44 L46 22 M46 22 L30 22 M46 22 L46 38\" stroke=\"#FF6A00\" stroke-width=\"8\" stroke-linecap=\"square\" fill=\"none\"/></svg>\n    <b>Organ<i>izer</i></b>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"ed\">Edition 01 · 2026</div>\n  <div class=\"presents\">Presents</div>\n\n  <div class=\"gpu\">\n    <div class=\"glow\"></div>\n    <div class=\"bracket\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>\n    <div class=\"power\"></div>\n    <div class=\"body\">\n      <div class=\"strip\"></div>\n      <div class=\"slash\"></div>\n      <div class=\"fan a\"><s></s><i></i></div>\n      <div class=\"fan b\"><s></s><i></i></div>\n      <div class=\"fan c\"><s></s><i></i></div>\n      <div class=\"model\">Ultra 9000 · 24GB</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"fingers\"></div>\n    <div class=\"ph\">缺图 · 可换成显卡 / 展位实拍</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"rib l\">50+<small>Brands</small></div>\n  <div class=\"rib r\"><small>Live rigs</small>300+</div>\n\n  <div class=\"t1\">PC Gaming</div>\n  <div class=\"t2\">Ex<i>p</i>o</div>\n\n  <div class=\"info\">\n    <div class=\"when\">10:00 AM – 8:00 PM<b></b>14 – 16 NOVEMBER 2026</div>\n    <div class=\"venue\">Venue Name · Exhibition Hall</div>\n    <div class=\"addr\">123 Anywhere St., Any City, ST 12345</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"url\"><span>www.yourevent.com</span></div>\n</div>\n","design":"# GPU Expo Poster · 显卡科技展览海报\n\n海报 · 1080×1350（Instagram 竖版 4:5，也可等比放大做 A 系列印刷）· 风格 futuristic / dark / bold · 行业 gaming / tech / events\n\n## 构图特征（这套的灵魂）\n- **近黑底 + 一个主色**：主色用主办方 logo 的品牌色（示例是橙色），整张只有「近黑 / 白 / 灰 / 主色」。主色同时出现在显卡光圈、标题里的一个字母、数据条和网址药丸，占画面 ≤ 20%。\n- **主视觉是一整张显卡的正面图**：横向占满画布宽度、居上，三风扇并排，每个风扇一圈发光的主色 RGB 环 + 暗色叶片 + 主色轮毂亮点；上缘一条主色光带；左侧银色挡板（I/O 口）、右上电源接口、下方金色 PCIe 金手指；卡的下面一团主色光晕当作「地面反光」。\n- 显卡下方压两条**数据条**（左 50+ 品牌 / 右 300+ 现场整机），一左一右贴边，半透明主色底 + 上下细线。\n- **宽体标题两层**：第一行「PC GAMING」小一号，第二行「EXPO」巨大，其中一个字母换成主色。字体用宽体无衬线（Unbounded 800），全大写。\n- 信息区居中三行：时间 | 日期（中间一条主色竖线）→ 场地（粗）→ 地址（灰）；底部主色实心网址药丸，两端渐隐的半调圆点。\n- 右上角斜光带 + 半调圆点（呼应运动海报的做法），背景有很淡的网格，中心被放射遮罩淡出。\n- 左上角放**主办方 logo**（深色底请用浅色 / 白色版），右上小字「Edition 01 · 年份」。\n\n## 不要\n- 不要把显卡画成真实品牌型号或放厂商 logo；型号文字用占位。\n- 不要多于一个主色；不要彩虹 RGB。\n- 不要给标题加描边、渐变、投影；不要斜体。\n- 不要让显卡和标题抢：显卡在上，标题在下，中间只放数据条。\n- 不要在海报里放长段文字；信息区不超过 3 行。\n\n## 文案口吻\n短、硬、数字说话（50+ 品牌、300+ 现场整机）。标题 2–3 个词。中文版：标题 2–4 个字 ×2 行（如「电竞 / 装机展」），Noto Sans SC 900，中文不用斜体、字距 0；小字保留英文大写作为版面元素。\n\n## 用法\n1. 主办方 logo：把 `.org` 整块换成 `<img>`（透明 PNG，宽约 380px），颜色 `--c-primary` 换成它的品牌色，其他颜色变量保持。\n2. 显卡区可保留 CSS 画的版本，也可换成真实显卡 / 展位照片（去背景、放在同一位置，保留下方光晕）。\n3. 所有文案、日期、数字、网址、地址都是占位，必须换成真实内容；没有素材的位置标「缺图」。\n4. 浏览器 1080×1350 视口截图导出 PNG；要出 1200×1697 的 A 系列版，把顶层 `width/height` 和各元素按 1.11 倍调整，或用 `swiss`/`gpu` 配方重新排版。\n"}